rompt_text\",\"Explain how to integrate emergency warning signs and urgent care flags effectively into a symptom search system to ensure critical cases are prominently highlighted and handled cautiously.\",\"receiver_followup_intent\",\"tailored_continuation\",\"receiver_followup_position\",3,\"source\",\"receiver_followups_tailored\",\"receiver_followup_treatment\",\"tailored\",\"receiver_followup_capability_scope\",\"logged_out\",\"receiver_followup_prompt_version\",\"v1\",\"receiver_followup_share_surface\",\"conversation_share\",\"Outline steps to implement symptom-based search in a medical library\",20581,20649,\"Describe detailed steps to build a symptom-based search engine that maps user input symptoms like 'fever and cough' to relevant medical conditions using the proposed database structure.\",\"Provide a JSON dataset example with diseases and symptoms for import\",20510,20578,\"Please provide a ready-to-import JSON dataset example containing diseases, symptoms, categories, synonyms, and mappings suitable for a searchable medical knowledge base.\",\" \",\"prefix\",20480,[],\"refs\",[],\"\",\"sources_footnote\",\"sources\",[404,405],\"has_images\",{\"_53\":408,\"_41\":202,\"_235\":409},{\"_53\":406,\"_41\":208,\"_235\":407},\"ICD-11\",\"World Health Organization\",\"Health Topics: MedlinePlus\",\"MedlinePlus\",\"citeturn0search4turn0search15\",20205,20238,[197,198,205,206],[],\"([World Health Organization](https://www.who.int/classifications/classification-of-diseases?utm_source=chatgpt.com))\",\"grouped_webpages\",\"items\",[424],\"fallback_items\",[],\"done\",\"error\",\"style\",{\"_53\":285,\"_41\":206,\"_235\":407,\"_233\":261,\"_229\":399,\"_425\":-5,\"_426\":427,\"_397\":428,\"_429\":-5,\"_430\":-5},\"attribution_segments\",\"supporting_websites\",[434],[431,432],\"hue\",\"attributions\",{\"_236\":237,\"_238\":239,\"_240\":433},{\"_236\":237,\"_238\":239,\"_240\":283},4,{\"_53\":280,\"_41\":198,\"_233\":-5,\"_229\":399,\"_235\":406},\"citeturn0search0turn0search2\",20046,20078,[199,200,201,202],[],\"([MedlinePlus](https://medlineplus.gov/healthtopics.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com))\",[443],[],{\"_53\":408,\"_41\":202,\"_235\":409,\"_233\":-5,\"_229\":399,\"_425\":-5,\"_426\":444,\"_397\":445,\"_429\":-5,\"_430\":-5},[448],[446,447],{\"_236\":237,\"_238\":239,\"_240\":237},{\"_236\":237,\"_238\":239,\"_240\":349},{\"_53\":346,\"_41\":200,\"_233\":-5,\"_229\":399,\"_235\":409},\"citeturn0search3turn0search4\",1017,1049,[205,206,207,208],[],\"([World Health Organization](https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/icd-11?utm_source=chatgpt.com))\",[457],[],{\"_53\":406,\"_41\":208,\"_235\":407,\"_233\":458,\"_229\":399,\"_425\":-5,\"_426\":459,\"_397\":460,\"_429\":-5,\"_430\":-5},1644451200,[463],[461,462],{\"_236\":237,\"_238\":239,\"_240\":374},{\"_236\":237,\"_238\":239,\"_240\":433},{\"_53\":285,\"_41\":206,\"_233\":-5,\"_229\":399,\"_235\":407},\"citeturn0search0turn0search10\",703,736,[201,202,203,204],[],[471],[],{\"_53\":408,\"_41\":202,\"_235\":409,\"_233\":-5,\"_229\":399,\"_425\":-5,\"_426\":472,\"_397\":473,\"_429\":-5,\"_430\":-5},[476],[474,475],{\"_236\":237,\"_238\":239,\"_240\":237},{\"_236\":237,\"_238\":239,\"_240\":325},{\"_53\":322,\"_41\":204,\"_233\":-5,\"_229\":399,\"_235\":409},\"stop\",\"stop_tokens\",[480],200002,\"content_type\",\"text\",\"parts\",[485],\"Yes. For the UI in your screenshot, I’d build the library as a **searchable medical knowledge base**, where each condition has:\\n\\n- **Disease / condition name**\\n- **Common names / synonyms**\\n- **Symptoms**\\n- **Body system / category**\\n- **Short description**\\n- **Common causes / risk factors**\\n- **When to seek urgent care**\\n- **Related conditions**\\n- **Search keywords**\\n\\nThis structure works much better than storing only disease names because users may search **“fever and cough”**, **“chest pain”**, or **“burning while urinating”** rather than knowing the disease name. MedlinePlus similarly organizes health information across diseases, conditions, symptoms, body systems, and other health topics. citeturn0search0turn0search10\\n\\nFor a production medical library, I would also keep an **ICD-11 identifier** field where appropriate. WHO describes ICD-11 as the international standard for recording and classifying diseases and health conditions, and its current release has a very large diagnostic vocabulary. citeturn0search3turn0search4\\n\\n## Recommended disease library\\n\\nBelow is a strong **starter dataset of 150+ conditions**, organized alphabetically so it fits your A–Z interface.\\n\\n### A\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Acne | pimples, blackheads, whiteheads, oily skin, inflamed skin |\\n| Acute Bronchitis | cough, mucus, chest discomfort, fatigue, mild fever |\\n| Allergic Rhinitis | sneezing, runny nose, itchy nose, nasal congestion, watery eyes |\\n| Alzheimer’s Disease | memory loss, confusion, difficulty thinking, personality changes |\\n| Anemia | fatigue, weakness, pale skin, dizziness, shortness of breath |\\n| Angina | chest pressure, chest tightness, chest pain, pain with exertion |\\n| Ankylosing Spondylitis | back pain, stiffness, reduced spinal mobility |\\n| Anxiety Disorder | excessive worry, restlessness, rapid heartbeat, difficulty sleeping |\\n| Appendicitis | right lower abdominal pain, nausea, vomiting, fever, loss of appetite |\\n| Asthma | wheezing, cough, shortness of breath, chest tightness |\\n| Atrial Fibrillation | irregular heartbeat, palpitations, fatigue, dizziness, shortness of breath |\\n| Autism Spectrum Disorder | social communication difficulties, repetitive behaviors, sensory differences |\\n| Arthritis | joint pain, stiffness, swelling, reduced movement |\\n\\n### B\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Bacterial Vaginosis | unusual vaginal discharge, fishy odor, irritation |\\n| Bell’s Palsy | facial weakness, facial drooping, difficulty closing one eye |\\n| Benign Prostatic Hyperplasia | frequent urination, weak urine stream, difficulty starting urination |\\n| Bipolar Disorder | mood swings, mania, depression, increased energy, impulsivity |\\n| Bladder Infection | burning urination, frequent urination, pelvic discomfort |\\n| Blood Clot / Deep Vein Thrombosis | leg swelling, leg pain, warmth, redness |\\n| Bone Fracture | pain, swelling, bruising, deformity, inability to move |\\n| Bronchitis | persistent cough, mucus, chest discomfort, fatigue |\\n| Bronchiolitis | cough, wheezing, rapid breathing, difficulty breathing |\\n| Breast Cancer | breast lump, nipple changes, breast skin changes, nipple discharge |\\n| Bronchiectasis | chronic cough, mucus production, recurrent respiratory infections |\\n\\n### C\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Celiac Disease | diarrhea, bloating, abdominal pain, weight loss, fatigue |\\n| Cervical Cancer | abnormal vaginal bleeding, pelvic pain, unusual discharge |\\n| Chickenpox | itchy rash, fluid-filled blisters, fever, fatigue |\\n| Chronic Kidney Disease | fatigue, swelling, changes in urination, nausea |\\n| Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD) | chronic cough, mucus, wheezing, shortness of breath |\\n| Cirrhosis | fatigue, jaundice, abdominal swelling, easy bruising |\\n| Common Cold | runny nose, sore throat, cough, sneezing, congestion |\\n| Conjunctivitis | red eyes, itching, discharge, watery eyes |\\n| Constipation | infrequent stools, hard stools, straining, abdominal discomfort |\\n| Coronary Artery Disease | chest pain, shortness of breath, fatigue |\\n| Crohn’s Disease | abdominal pain, diarrhea, weight loss, fatigue |\\n| Cystic Fibrosis | chronic cough, thick mucus, recurrent lung infections, poor growth |\\n| Cushing Syndrome | weight gain, high blood pressure, muscle weakness, easy bruising |\\n\\n### D\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Dengue | high fever, severe headache, muscle pain, joint pain, rash |\\n| Depression | persistent sadness, loss of interest, fatigue, sleep changes |\\n| Dermatitis | itchy skin, redness, rash, dry or inflamed skin |\\n| Diabetes Mellitus | increased thirst, frequent urination, fatigue, blurred vision |\\n| Diarrhea | loose stools, abdominal cramps, urgency, dehydration |\\n| Diverticulitis | lower abdominal pain, fever, nausea, bowel changes |\\n| Down Syndrome | developmental delay, characteristic physical features, learning difficulties |\\n| Dry Eye Disease | burning, gritty feeling, redness, watery eyes, blurred vision |\\n| Dyslexia | difficulty reading, spelling problems, difficulty recognizing words |\\n\\n### E\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Ear Infection | ear pain, fever, hearing difficulty, fluid drainage |\\n| Eczema | itchy skin, dry skin, rash, redness |\\n| Endometriosis | painful periods, pelvic pain, painful intercourse, infertility |\\n| Epilepsy | recurrent seizures, loss of awareness, unusual movements |\\n| Erectile Dysfunction | difficulty achieving or maintaining erection |\\n| Esophageal Cancer | difficulty swallowing, weight loss, chest discomfort |\\n| Essential Tremor | involuntary shaking, hand tremor, difficulty with precise movements |\\n| Eye Infection | redness, discharge, swelling, irritation |\\n\\n### F\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Fatty Liver Disease | often no symptoms, fatigue, abdominal discomfort |\\n| Fibromyalgia | widespread pain, fatigue, sleep problems, cognitive difficulties |\\n| Food Allergy | hives, swelling, vomiting, abdominal pain, breathing difficulty |\\n| Food Poisoning | nausea, vomiting, diarrhea, abdominal cramps, fever |\\n| Gallstones | upper abdominal pain, nausea, vomiting, pain after meals |\\n| Gastritis | upper abdominal pain, nausea, indigestion, bloating |\\n| Gastroesophageal Reflux Disease (GERD) | heartburn, acid reflux, chest discomfort, sour taste |\\n| Gastroenteritis | vomiting, diarrhea, abdominal cramps, fever |\\n| Glaucoma | often no early symptoms, peripheral vision loss, eye pain in acute cases |\\n| Gout | sudden severe joint pain, swelling, redness, tenderness |\\n\\n### H\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Hashimoto’s Thyroiditis | fatigue, weight gain, cold intolerance, dry skin |\\n| Hay Fever | sneezing, itchy eyes, runny nose, congestion |\\n| Heart Failure | shortness of breath, leg swelling, fatigue, rapid heartbeat |\\n| Hepatitis | fatigue, nausea, abdominal pain, jaundice, dark urine |\\n| Hepatitis B | fatigue, nausea, jaundice, abdominal discomfort |\\n| Hepatitis C | often asymptomatic, fatigue, jaundice, abdominal discomfort |\\n| Hernia | bulge, localized pain, discomfort with lifting or coughing |\\n| Herpes | painful blisters, sores, itching, burning |\\n| High Blood Pressure | often no symptoms; severe cases may cause headache or visual changes |\\n| High Cholesterol | usually no symptoms |\\n| HIV Infection | fever, fatigue, swollen lymph nodes, recurrent infections |\\n| Hyperthyroidism | weight loss, rapid heartbeat, anxiety, sweating, tremor |\\n| Hypothyroidism | fatigue, weight gain, cold intolerance, constipation, dry skin |\\n\\n### I\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| IBS — Irritable Bowel Syndrome | abdominal pain, bloating, diarrhea, constipation |\\n| Inflammatory Bowel Disease | abdominal pain, diarrhea, fatigue, weight loss |\\n| Influenza | fever, cough, body aches, headache, fatigue |\\n| Insomnia | difficulty falling asleep, waking frequently, daytime fatigue |\\n| Iron Deficiency Anemia | fatigue, weakness, dizziness, pale skin |\\n| Ischemic Heart Disease | chest pain, shortness of breath, fatigue |\\n\\n### J\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Jaundice | yellow skin, yellow eyes, dark urine, pale stools |\\n| Juvenile Arthritis | joint pain, swelling, stiffness, reduced mobility |\\n\\n### K\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Kidney Infection | fever, back/flank pain, painful urination, nausea |\\n| Kidney Stones | severe side/back pain, blood in urine, nausea, painful urination |\\n| Kidney Disease | swelling, fatigue, urinary changes, nausea |\\n| Knee Osteoarthritis | knee pain, stiffness, swelling, reduced mobility |\\n\\n### L\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Lactose Intolerance | bloating, diarrhea, gas, abdominal cramps after dairy |\\n| Laryngitis | hoarse voice, loss of voice, sore throat, cough |\\n| Leukemia | fatigue, frequent infections, bruising, bleeding, fever |\\n| Liver Disease | fatigue, jaundice, abdominal swelling, nausea |\\n| Lung Cancer | persistent cough, chest pain, coughing blood, weight loss |\\n| Lupus | fatigue, joint pain, rash, fever, sensitivity to sunlight |\\n| Lyme Disease | rash, fever, headache, fatigue, joint pain |\\n\\n### M\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Malaria | fever, chills, sweating, headache, muscle aches |\\n| Melanoma | changing mole, irregular skin lesion, changes in color or size |\\n| Migraine | severe headache, nausea, light sensitivity, sound sensitivity |\\n| Multiple Sclerosis | vision problems, weakness, numbness, balance problems |\\n| Mumps | swollen salivary glands, fever, headache, jaw pain |\\n| Muscular Dystrophy | progressive muscle weakness, difficulty walking, falls |\\n\\n### N\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Narcolepsy | excessive daytime sleepiness, sudden sleep attacks, cataplexy |\\n| Nasal Polyps | nasal congestion, reduced smell, runny nose |\\n| Nephritis | blood in urine, swelling, high blood pressure, reduced kidney function |\\n| Norovirus Infection | sudden vomiting, diarrhea, abdominal cramps |\\n| Non-Hodgkin Lymphoma | swollen lymph nodes, fever, night sweats, weight loss |\\n\\n### O\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Obesity | excessive body weight, reduced mobility, fatigue |\\n| Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder | intrusive thoughts, compulsive behaviors, anxiety |\\n| Osteoarthritis | joint pain, stiffness, swelling, reduced movement |\\n| Osteoporosis | often no symptoms until fracture, back pain, fractures |\\n| Otitis Media | ear pain, fever, hearing problems |\\n\\n### P\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Pancreatitis | severe upper abdominal pain, nausea, vomiting, fever |\\n| Parkinson’s Disease | tremor, slow movement, stiffness, balance problems |\\n| Peptic Ulcer Disease | abdominal pain, indigestion, nausea, bloating |\\n| Peripheral Artery Disease | leg pain while walking, cold feet, numbness |\\n| Pneumonia | cough, fever, chest pain, shortness of breath |\\n| Polio | fever, weakness, muscle pain, paralysis in severe cases |\\n| Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS) | irregular periods, acne, excess hair growth, infertility |\\n| Psoriasis | scaly skin patches, itching, redness |\\n| Psoriatic Arthritis | joint pain, swelling, stiffness, psoriasis |\\n| Pulmonary Embolism | sudden shortness of breath, chest pain, rapid heartbeat |\\n| Pulmonary Hypertension | shortness of breath, fatigue, chest pain, dizziness |\\n| Panic Disorder | sudden intense fear, palpitations, sweating, shortness of breath |\\n| Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder | intrusive memories, avoidance, hypervigilance, sleep problems |\\n\\n### Q\\n\\nThere are relatively few common consumer-facing conditions beginning with Q. Useful entries include:\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Q Fever | fever, headache, fatigue, muscle aches, cough |\\n| QT Syndrome / Long QT Syndrome | fainting, seizures, palpitations, potentially dangerous arrhythmias |\\n\\n### R\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Rabies | fever, confusion, difficulty swallowing, agitation |\\n| Rheumatoid Arthritis | joint pain, swelling, morning stiffness, fatigue |\\n| Ringworm | circular itchy rash, redness, scaling |\\n| Rosacea | facial redness, flushing, visible blood vessels, bumps |\\n| Rotavirus Infection | diarrhea, vomiting, fever, dehydration |\\n| RSV Infection | cough, runny nose, wheezing, breathing difficulty |\\n\\n### S\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Schizophrenia | hallucinations, delusions, disorganized thinking, social withdrawal |\\n| Sciatica | lower back pain, leg pain, numbness, tingling |\\n| Scoliosis | curved spine, uneven shoulders, back discomfort |\\n| Sepsis | fever or low temperature, rapid heart rate, confusion, breathing difficulty |\\n| Shingles | painful rash, burning, blisters, usually one side of body |\\n| Sinusitis | facial pressure, nasal congestion, headache, thick nasal discharge |\\n| Sleep Apnea | loud snoring, breathing pauses, daytime sleepiness |\\n| Skin Cancer | changing mole, unusual skin growth, non-healing sore |\\n| Stomach Cancer | abdominal discomfort, nausea, weight loss, early fullness |\\n| Stroke | facial drooping, arm weakness, speech difficulty, sudden confusion |\\n| Strep Throat | sore throat, fever, painful swallowing, swollen lymph nodes |\\n| Systemic Lupus Erythematosus | fatigue, joint pain, rash, fever |\\n| Sickle Cell Disease | anemia, pain crises, fatigue, swelling |\\n| Skin Allergy | itching, redness, rash, swelling |\\n\\n### T\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Tension Headache | pressure-like headache, scalp/neck tenderness |\\n| Testicular Cancer | testicular lump, swelling, heaviness, discomfort |\\n| Tetanus | muscle stiffness, jaw locking, painful muscle spasms |\\n| Thyroid Cancer | neck lump, difficulty swallowing, hoarseness |\\n| Tonsillitis | sore throat, swollen tonsils, fever, difficulty swallowing |\\n| Tuberculosis | persistent cough, fever, night sweats, weight loss |\\n| Type 1 Diabetes | excessive thirst, frequent urination, weight loss, fatigue |\\n| Type 2 Diabetes | increased thirst, frequent urination, fatigue, blurred vision |\\n\\n### U\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Ulcerative Colitis | diarrhea, blood in stool, abdominal pain, urgency |\\n| Urinary Tract Infection (UTI) | burning urination, frequent urination, urgency, pelvic pain |\\n| Uterine Fibroids | heavy periods, pelvic pressure, abdominal pain, frequent urination |\\n| Uveitis | eye pain, redness, light sensitivity, blurred vision |\\n\\n### V\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Vaginitis | vaginal itching, irritation, discharge, odor |\\n| Varicose Veins | enlarged veins, aching legs, swelling |\\n| Viral Gastroenteritis | vomiting, diarrhea, abdominal cramps, fever |\\n| Vitiligo | loss of skin pigment, white patches |\\n| Vitamin B12 Deficiency | fatigue, weakness, numbness, tingling, anemia |\\n| Vitamin D Deficiency | bone/muscle pain, weakness, fatigue |\\n\\n### W\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Whooping Cough / Pertussis | severe coughing fits, vomiting after coughing, whooping sound |\\n| Wilson Disease | liver problems, neurological symptoms, movement problems |\\n| Wolff-Parkinson-White Syndrome | rapid heartbeat, palpitations, dizziness, fainting |\\n\\n### X\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Xeroderma Pigmentosum | extreme sun sensitivity, skin damage, early skin cancers |\\n| Xerostomia / Dry Mouth | dry mouth, difficulty swallowing, increased thirst |\\n\\n### Y\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Yellow Fever | fever, headache, muscle pain, nausea, jaundice |\\n| Yaws | skin lesions, ulcers, bone pain, swelling |\\n\\n### Z\\n\\n| Disease / Condition | Common symptoms / search terms |\\n|---|---|\\n| Zika Virus Infection | fever, rash, joint pain, red eyes, headache |\\n| Zollinger-Ellison Syndrome | abdominal pain, severe/recurrent ulcers, diarrhea, acid reflux |\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Don't make the library only disease-based\\n\\nFor the search box shown in your screenshot, I'd actually create **two related datasets**:\\n\\n### 1. Conditions\\n\\nExample:\\n\\n```json\\n{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Pneumonia\\\",\\n  \\\"slug\\\": \\\"pneumonia\\\",\\n  \\\"category\\\": \\\"Respiratory\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"An infection that causes inflammation of the air sacs in one or both lungs.\\\",\\n  \\\"symptoms\\\": [\\n    \\\"Cough\\\",\\n    \\\"Fever\\\",\\n    \\\"Chills\\\",\\n    \\\"Shortness of breath\\\",\\n    \\\"Chest pain\\\",\\n    \\\"Fatigue\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"keywords\\\": [\\n    \\\"lung infection\\\",\\n    \\\"chest infection\\\",\\n    \\\"cough with fever\\\",\\n    \\\"breathing difficulty\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"body_system\\\": \\\"Lungs and respiratory system\\\"\\n}\\n```\\n\\n### 2. Symptoms\\n\\nThis is important because your placeholder specifically says:\\n\\n\u003e \\\"Enter your symptoms (e.g., 'fever and cough') to find possible conditions.\\\"\\n\\nSo your symptom library should include things such as:\\n\\n**General**\\n- Fever\\n- Chills\\n- Fatigue\\n- Weakness\\n- Weight loss\\n- Weight gain\\n- Sweating\\n- Night sweats\\n- Dehydration\\n\\n**Pain**\\n- Headache\\n- Migraine\\n- Chest pain\\n- Abdominal pain\\n- Back pain\\n- Pelvic pain\\n- Joint pain\\n- Muscle pain\\n- Neck pain\\n- Ear pain\\n- Eye pain\\n- Tooth pain\\n\\n**Respiratory**\\n- Cough\\n- Dry cough\\n- Productive cough\\n- Shortness of breath\\n- Wheezing\\n- Difficulty breathing\\n- Runny nose\\n- Nasal congestion\\n- Sneezing\\n- Sore throat\\n- Hoarseness\\n\\n**Digestive**\\n- Nausea\\n- Vomiting\\n- Diarrhea\\n- Constipation\\n- Bloating\\n- Gas\\n- Heartburn\\n- Acid reflux\\n- Abdominal cramps\\n- Blood in stool\\n- Loss of appetite\\n\\n**Neurological**\\n- Dizziness\\n- Vertigo\\n- Tremor\\n- Numbness\\n- Tingling\\n- Weakness\\n- Seizures\\n- Confusion\\n- Memory loss\\n- Fainting\\n- Balance problems\\n\\n**Skin**\\n- Rash\\n- Itching\\n- Hives\\n- Swelling\\n- Redness\\n- Dry skin\\n- Blisters\\n- Skin discoloration\\n- Hair loss\\n- Skin lumps\\n\\n**Urinary**\\n- Painful urination\\n- Burning urination\\n- Frequent urination\\n- Urinary urgency\\n- Blood in urine\\n- Difficulty urinating\\n- Weak urine stream\\n- Incontinence\\n\\n**Eye**\\n- Blurred vision\\n- Double vision\\n- Red eyes\\n- Watery eyes\\n- Eye discharge\\n- Light sensitivity\\n- Vision loss\\n- Eye floaters\\n\\n**Mental health**\\n- Anxiety\\n- Panic attacks\\n- Persistent sadness\\n- Loss of interest\\n- Mood swings\\n- Insomnia\\n- Excessive sleepiness\\n- Difficulty concentrating\\n- Intrusive thoughts\\n\\n---\\n\\n# A better database structure\\n\\nIf you're building this into your website, I recommend something like:\\n\\n```text\\nconditions\\n├── id\\n├── name\\n├── slug\\n├── category\\n├── body_system\\n├── short_description\\n├── detailed_description\\n├── common_symptoms\\n├── less_common_symptoms\\n├── causes\\n├── risk_factors\\n├── complications\\n├── diagnosis\\n├── treatment_overview\\n├── prevention\\n├── when_to_seek_help\\n├── emergency_warning_signs\\n├── synonyms\\n├── search_keywords\\n├── icd11_code\\n└── last_reviewed\\n```\\n\\nAnd a separate:\\n\\n```text\\nsymptoms\\n├── id\\n├── name\\n├── slug\\n├── category\\n├── description\\n├── synonyms\\n└── related_conditions\\n```\\n\\nThen create a relationship table:\\n\\n```text\\ncondition_symptoms\\n├── condition_id\\n├── symptom_id\\n├── relevance\\n└── typical\\n```\\n\\nThis lets your search engine handle something like:\\n\\n\u003e **\\\"fever + cough + chest pain\\\"**\\n\\nand return:\\n\\n1. Pneumonia\\n2. Influenza\\n3. Acute bronchitis\\n4. COVID-19\\n5. Tuberculosis\\n6. Asthma exacerbation\\n7. Pulmonary embolism\\n\\nrather than simply matching the text `\\\"fever\\\"`.\\n\\n**Important:** these results should be presented as *possible matches, not diagnoses*. The database should also have an explicit emergency-warning layer—for example, sudden severe chest pain, severe breathing difficulty, sudden facial/arm weakness, or severe confusion should not be handled as ordinary symptom-search results.\\n\\nFor the medical content itself, **MedlinePlus/NLM** is a good patient-facing reference because it covers 1,000+ health topics and provides information on symptoms, causes, treatment and prevention. citeturn0search0turn0search2 For standardized condition terminology, use the current **WHO ICD-11** rather than inventing your own medical classification. citeturn0search4turn0search15\\n\\nIf this is for the **website you're currently building**, I can also turn this into a **ready-to-import JSON/SQL dataset with 300–500 diseases, 500+ symptoms, categories, synonyms, and disease↔symptom mappings** suitable for your search UI.\\n\\n---\\n\\nIf you want, I can:\\n\\n- Provide a JSON dataset example with diseases and symptoms for import\\n- Outline steps to implement symptom-based search in a medical library\\n- Explain how to integrate emergency warning flags into symptom search results\",\"role\",\"assistant\",{\"_489\":490},\"real_author\",\"tool:web\",{\"_129\":133,\"_136\":494,\"_54\":495,\"_140\":496,\"_142\":143,\"_144\":14,\"_145\":146,\"_147\":497,\"_149\":150},\"0254f4f1-739e-4c47-b339-b57ca5f30484\",[81],{\"_486\":487,\"_147\":510},1788889865.056841,{\"_481\":508,\"_140\":509},{\"_498\":499,\"_500\":374,\"_501\":502,\"_503\":504,\"_505\":506,\"_168\":169,\"_170\":34,\"_171\":172,\"_173\":174,\"_175\":176,\"_177\":176,\"_165\":67,\"_178\":67,\"_66\":67,\"_179\":14,\"_180\":492,\"_507\":34,\"_181\":10},\"reasoning_status\",\"reasoning_ended\",\"finished_duration_sec\",\"reasoning_start_time\",178888